      <section id="sect-00002">
      <title>Video: Finding Solutions to Inequalities on the Coordinate Plane</title>
      <para id="para-00030">Watch the following video to learn more about solutions to inequalities on the
        coordinate plane.</para>
      <media alt="Placeholder for Alt Text">
        <iframe width="660" height="371.4" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/40c6306a9de7c7d071feeec89cc16d923cad19e0"/>
