    <section id="sect-00003">
      <note class="self-check" id="note-00002">
        <para id="para-00031">Which ordered pair is a solution to the inequality graphed here?</para>
        
          <media alt="">
            <image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/Algebra-1_02_13_04_01.jpg"/>
          </media>
        
        <para id="para-00032">
        \(y\;>\;\;\frac45x\;–\;\frac85\)</para>
